<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Get Extension - Share Tabs</title>
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.0.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet" integrity="sha384-EVSTQN3/azprG1Anm3QDgpJLIm9Nao0Yz1ztcQTwFspd3yD65VohhpuuCOmLASjC" crossorigin="anonymous" />
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg-1: #07111f;
      --bg-2: #0f172a;
      --card: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.7);
      --border: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.22);
      --text: #e2e8f0;
      --muted: #94a3b8;
      --primary: #60a5fa;
      --success: #34d399;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top, rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.15), transparent 30%), linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bg-1), var(--bg-2));
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
    }

    .panel {
      width: min(900px, calc(100% - 32px));
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 24px;
      box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.35);
      padding: 32px 28px;
      backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
    }

    .header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 16px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .title {
      margin: 0;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3vw, 2.4rem);
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #dbeafe, #93c5fd 40%, #34d399 100%);
      background-clip: text;
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      color: transparent;
    }

    .back-link {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-top: 10px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      transition: color 0.2s ease;
    }

    .back-link:hover {
      color: #bae6fd;
    }

    .download-btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 9px;
      min-height: 48px;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), #3b82f6);
      color: white;
      padding: 0 18px;
      font-weight: 700;
      box-shadow: 0 16px 30px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.24);
      text-decoration: none;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .download-btn:hover {
      color: white;
      filter: brightness(1.08);
    }

    .download-group {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-end;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .compatibility-note {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.76rem;
    }

    .info {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
      margin-top: 22px;
    }

    .platform-card {
      padding: 22px 20px;
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.7);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 18px;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .platform-card h2 {
      margin: 0 0 14px;
      color: var(--text);
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .platform-card p {
      margin: 0 0 12px;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .platform-card strong {
      color: var(--text);
    }

    a {
      color: #7dd3fc;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    a:hover {
      color: #bae6fd;
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      body {
        align-items: flex-start;
        padding: 16px 0;
      }

      .header {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
        align-items: start;
        gap: 18px;
      }

      .panel {
        padding: 22px 18px;
      }

      .download-btn {
        width: 100%;
      }

      .download-group {
        align-items: stretch;
      }

      .compatibility-note {
        text-align: center;
      }

      .info {
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      }

      .platform-card {
        padding: 20px 16px;
        overflow-wrap: anywhere;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="panel">
    <div class="header">
      <div>
        <h1 class="title">Extension setup</h1>
        <a class="back-link" href="/">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true">
            <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M15 8a.5.5 0 0 1-.5.5H2.707l3.147 3.146a.5.5 0 0 1-.708.708l-4-4a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708l4-4a.5.5 0 1 1 .708.708L2.707 7.5H14.5A.5.5 0 0 1 15 8z"/>
          </svg>
          Back to tabs
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="download-group">
        <a class="download-btn" href="/sharetabs.zip" download>
          Download for Chrome
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M.5 9.9a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v2.5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h12a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-2.5a.5.5 0 0 1 1 0v2.5a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H2a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-2.5a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5z"/>
            <path d="M7.646 11.854a.5.5 0 0 0 .708 0l3-3a.5.5 0 0 0-.708-.708L8.5 10.293V1.5a.5.5 0 0 0-1 0v8.793L5.354 8.146a.5.5 0 1 0-.708.708l3 3z"/>
          </svg>
        </a>
        <a class="download-btn" href="/sharetabs-firefox.zip" download>
          Download for Firefox
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M.5 9.9a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v2.5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h12a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-2.5a.5.5 0 0 1 1 0v2.5a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H2a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-2.5a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5z"/>
            <path d="M7.646 11.854a.5.5 0 0 0 .708 0l3-3a.5.5 0 0 0-.708-.708L8.5 10.293V1.5a.5.5 0 0 0-1 0v8.793L5.354 8.146a.5.5 0 1 0-.708.708l3 3z"/>
          </svg>
        </a>
        <p class="compatibility-note">Choose the package for your browser.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="info">
      <section class="platform-card">
        <h2>Chrome and Chromium browsers</h2>
        <p>1. Download and extract the ZIP file.</p>
        <p>2. Open <strong>chrome://extensions</strong> (or <strong>edge://extensions</strong>) and enable Developer mode.</p>
        <p>3. Select <strong>Load unpacked</strong> and choose the extracted extension folder containing <strong>manifest.json</strong>.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="platform-card">
        <h2>Firefox</h2>
        <p>1. Download and extract the Firefox ZIP file.</p>
        <p>2. Open <strong>about:debugging#/runtime/this-firefox</strong> and select <strong>Load Temporary Add-on</strong>.</p>
        <p>3. Choose <strong>manifest.json</strong> inside the extracted folder.</p>
        <p><strong>Note:</strong> Temporary add-ons are removed when Firefox closes. Permanent installation requires a signed add-on.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>

</body>
</html>